THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS REDISTRIBUTED IN THIS SOURCE TREE

Listed here because the files themselves are committed and shipped, not merely
depended on. A package resolved at build time is covered by its own manifest; a
binary in this repository travels with whatever we say about it, and nothing else.

Web fonts (web/public/fonts/)
-----------------------------
The web application serves its own typography rather than loading it from a CDN
(ADR-026), which makes this project a redistributor of both families. Each is
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, whose section 2 requires
that the copyright notice and licence accompany the font files. Both are in
web/public/fonts/ beside the .woff2 files they cover, and are served from the
built application at /fonts/, so they reach anyone who receives the fonts.

  Inter
  Copyright (c) 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 — web/public/fonts/inter-OFL.txt

  JetBrains Mono
  Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
  (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 — web/public/fonts/jetbrains-mono-OFL.txt

Neither font is modified. The .woff2 files are the upstream builds Google Fonts
serves, subset by Unicode range; web/tools/vendor-fonts.mjs reproduces them.
